"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Have a history of suicidal behavior\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"or suicidal ideation\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"AND\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Have a score of 3 or higher on the Hamilton Anxiety Rating Scale (HAMA)\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"and a score of 21 or higher on the Hamilton Depression Rating Scale (HAMD)\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Are pregnant or lactating\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"or have a history of allergy or hypersensitivity to tandospirone\"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Have serious or unstable cardiac, renal, neurologic, cerebrovascular, metabolic, or pulmonary disease\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Have a history of secondary anxiety disorders\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Have a history of drug or alcohol dependence within the last year\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"or are currently taking benzodiazepine drugs\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"right\": {\n      \"OR\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"raw_text\": \"Are drivers or operators of dangerous machines\"\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"OR\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Have participated in other clinical studies within the last 30 days\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Have clinically significant ECG or laboratory abnormalities\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Have a history of epilepsy\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"or abnormal TSH concentration\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"